Subject: Use the real Windows alloca header for native font compilation
Upstream-base: 2c5c51e483b652d178ef06a44b83b07a0f97d2a6

LLVM-MinGW defines _WIN32 without _MSC_VER. Select its real malloc.h/_alloca provider.
Apply after the reviewed native __alloca macro guards (0660); retain those guards and all font logic.

--- a/src/NL/nlFont.cpp
+++ b/src/NL/nlFont.cpp
@@ -9,7 +9,7 @@
 #if defined(MSCHARGED_NATIVE)
 #include <stdint.h>
 #include <type_traits>
-#if defined(_MSC_VER)
+#if defined(_MSC_VER) || defined(_WIN32)
 #include <malloc.h>
 #ifndef __alloca
 #define __alloca _alloca
